    "headline": "W. R. Berkley Corporation Announces Senior Executive Appointments",
    "summary": "GREENWICH, Conn., July 27, 2026--W. R. Berkley Corporation (NYSE: WRB) today announced the appointment of Daniel R. Westcott as executive vice president. Robert R. Coyne, Jr. will succeed Mr. Westcott as president of Berkley Re America. In addition, Robert C. Hewitt, executive vice president of the Company, has been named chairman of Berkley Re. The appointments are effective immediately.",
